column5:
Below is the payload-schema:
{
  "order": int,
  "version_id": int/null
}

column7:
order: integer type which sets the order of the video in the list
version_id: applicable when different version of a video is used, otherwise null

Precondition: homepageResources setting must be FALSE for this endpoint to work

Success Response:
{
  "body": true,
  "status": {
    "message": "Okay",
    "code": "ok",
    "code_text": "Video Added Successfully"
  }
}
